1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,970
An AI agent just bought something for you.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,370
The payment succeeded. But the delivery
went wrong.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,120
Who makes it right?

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Meet Afterpact ... the assurance layer for
agentic commerce.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:24,690
No setup. No script to follow. One click
runs the whole story ... a delivery gone wrong, recovered, held, and refused ... every step proven.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,860
Then PayPal executes. Real orders. Real
captures.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,150
Recorded sandbox runs prove the loop end
to end.

8
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,580
But here's what nobody shows you.

9
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,160
Three sensor kits were promised. Two
arrived.

10
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:48,320
The Outcome Twin lays it bare: what was
promised, what actually happened ... and what's still missing.

11
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:54,610
One kit. A hundred twenty-nine dollars and
ninety-nine cents. Unaccounted for.

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,960
So Afterpact goes to work.

13
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:04,390
AI reads the evidence and proposes a
partial refund.

14
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:09,120
A deterministic policy checks every cent
against the capture.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,350
A human approves. And PayPal confirms the
refund ... verified at the provider, not just on screen.

16
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,360
Every step lands in the Flight Recorder.

17
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,960
A hash-chained, replayable record you can
hand to your ops team ... or your auditor.

18
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:36,260
This isn't a demo trick. It's the artifact
merchants keep.

19
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,770
The same evidence powers real
intelligence.

20
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:51,120
Recorded model runs ... every citation
checked ... and a licensed analytics studio, with its own AI risk analyst, over the same data.

21
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:54,200
Nothing here is faked. And everything is
labeled.

22
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:01,410
And when something malicious shows up ...
a merchant swap, an inflated amount ...

23
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:06,840
the policy engine refuses. Same input,
same refusal. Forever.

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,700
AI can buy anything.

25
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:15,200
Afterpact makes sure the outcome matches
the promise.
